@startuml agentic-vs-autonomous-culture
title Agentic vs Autonomous Culture Orthogonality ; per ADR-ES-024 section 5 + ADR-ES-022 section 5

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Culture" as Cult
class "Agentic Culture" as AgCult
class "Autonomous Culture" as AuCult
class "Agentic + Autonomous Culture" as BothCult

Cult <|-- AgCult : specializes (v2.1.0)
Cult <|-- AuCult : specializes (v2.2.0)
AgCult ..> BothCult : compositional future
AuCult ..> BothCult : compositional future

note bottom of Cult
  Per ADR-ES-024 section 5 + ADR-ES-022 section 5:
  - Agentic Culture does NOT imply Autonomous Culture
  - Autonomous Culture does NOT imply Agentic Culture
  - A Culture may be both
  - A Culture may be neither
  - Neither dimension subsumes the other
end note

@enduml
